{"seq":2,"slug":"planning-problem","title":"规划问题形式化","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/llm-agent-planning/foundations/planning-problem","wordCount":2188,"readingTime":9,"html":"<h1 id=\"规划问题形式化\">规划问题形式化</h1><p>&quot;订机票并加日历&quot;这句自然语言指令，在规划器眼里必须先变成可计算的对象，才能谈得上求解。经典 AI 在六十年里积累了一整套描述规划问题的数学语言——状态、动作、目标、转移。LLM 智能体并没有抛弃这套语言，而是把它&quot;软化&quot;了：状态可能是一段自然语言上下文而非逻辑命题，动作可能是一次工具调用而非形式化算子。理解这套形式化，能让你在后文比较各范式时说清它们到底在优化什么、又偷偷放弃了什么保证。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>一个规划问题最小可由四元组 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">⟨</mo><mi>S</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>A</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>T</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>G</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">⟩</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\langle S, A, T, G \\rangle</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">⟨</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">G</span><span class=\"mclose\">⟩</span></span></span></span></span> 刻画：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span></span></span></span></span>：状态空间，所有可能的世界配置。对智能体，一个状态可能是&quot;当前已查到的航班列表 + 日历内容 + 对话历史&quot;。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span></span></span></span></span>：动作空间，智能体可执行的全部动作（每个工具调用是一个带参动作）。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>:</mo><mi>S</mi><mo>×</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>→</mo><mi>S</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T: S \\times A \\to S</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">:</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span></span></span></span></span>：转移函数，执行动作后世界如何变化。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>G</mi><mo>⊆</mo><mi>S</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">G \\subseteq S</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8193em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">G</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">⊆</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span></span></span></span></span>：目标状态集合，满足任务要求的那些状态。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>规划即在此四元组上<strong>寻找一个动作序列</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>π</mi><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mo>…</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mi>n</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\pi = (a_1, a_2, \\dots, a_n)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">π</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\">…</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，使得从初始状态 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>s</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">s_0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 出发，依次施加这些动作后到达某个 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>s</mi><mi>n</mi></msub><mo>∈</mo><mi>G</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">s_n \\in G</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6891em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">G</span></span></span></span></span>。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    S0[初始状态 s0&lt;br/&gt;目标 + 空行程] --&gt;|a1 查航班| S1[s1&lt;br/&gt;得到航班列表]&#10;    S1 --&gt;|a2 选最便宜| S2[s2&lt;br/&gt;锁定候选]&#10;    S2 --&gt;|a3 下单| S3[s3&lt;br/&gt;拿到行程号]&#10;    S3 --&gt;|a4 写日历| SG[sG 属于 G&lt;br/&gt;目标达成]&#10;    S2 -.售罄.-&gt; X[转移失败&lt;br/&gt;触发重规划]&#10;    X -.-&gt; S1\">flowchart TD\n    S0[初始状态 s0&lt;br/&gt;目标 + 空行程] --&gt;|a1 查航班| S1[s1&lt;br/&gt;得到航班列表]\n    S1 --&gt;|a2 选最便宜| S2[s2&lt;br/&gt;锁定候选]\n    S2 --&gt;|a3 下单| S3[s3&lt;br/&gt;拿到行程号]\n    S3 --&gt;|a4 写日历| SG[sG 属于 G&lt;br/&gt;目标达成]\n    S2 -.售罄.-&gt; X[转移失败&lt;br/&gt;触发重规划]\n    X -.-&gt; S1</pre><p>经典规划与 LLM 智能体规划的核心差异，集中在这四个要素的&quot;可知性&quot;上，下表对照：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>要素</th>\n<th>经典 AI 规划（STRIPS/PDDL）</th>\n<th>LLM 智能体规划</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>状态 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>离散逻辑命题集合，完全可观测</td>\n<td>自然语言上下文，部分可观测</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>动作 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>有精确前置/效果的算子</td>\n<td>工具调用，效果常不确定</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>转移 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>确定、已知</td>\n<td>随机、需执行后才知</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>目标 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>G</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">G</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">G</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>形式化命题</td>\n<td>自然语言意图，可能模糊</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>求解</td>\n<td>符号搜索，保证最优/完备</td>\n<td>LLM 生成，启发式、无保证</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>这张表解释了一个关键事实：LLM 智能体规划<strong>牺牲了经典规划的完备性与最优性保证，换取了对开放、模糊、动态环境的适应力</strong>。第二章的各范式本质上是在这条取舍线上的不同站位。</p>\n<h2 id=\"确定性-马尔可夫与部分可观测\">确定性、马尔可夫与部分可观测</h2><p>当转移 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span></span> 是确定的、状态完全可观测时，规划退化为在状态图上找路径，BFS/DFS/A* 即可。但智能体的真实处境几乎从不如此理想。</p>\n<p>引入随机性后，转移变为概率分布 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mi>s</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup><mo>∣</mo><mi>s</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>a</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T(s&#x27; \\mid s, a)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0019em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7519em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">′</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，问题升级为<strong>马尔可夫决策过程（MDP）</strong>，目标从&quot;找一条路径&quot;变成&quot;找一个策略 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>π</mi><mo>:</mo><mi>S</mi><mo>→</mo><mi>A</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\pi: S \\to A</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">π</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">:</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span></span></span></span></span>&quot;，最大化期望累积回报：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>V</mi><mi>π</mi></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>s</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"double-struck\">E</mi><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">[</mo><munderover><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∞</mi></munderover><msup><mi>γ</mi><mi>t</mi></msup><mi>r</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>s</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mtext> </mtext><mo fence=\"true\" lspace=\"0.05em\" rspace=\"0.05em\">|</mo><mtext> </mtext><msub><mi>s</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>s</mi><mo fence=\"true\">]</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">V^\\pi(s) = \\mathbb{E}\\left[\\sum_{t=0}^{\\infty} \\gamma^t r(s_t, a_t) \\,\\middle|\\, s_0 = s\\right]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7144em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">π</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:3.0171em;vertical-align:-1.2671em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathbb\">E</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size4\">[</span></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.6514em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8829em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">=</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.3em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">∞</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2671em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\">γ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8436em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span><span class=\"delimsizing mult\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.75em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.75em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:5em;\"></span><span style=\"width:0.333em;height:3em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.333em\" height=\"3em\" viewBox=\"0 0 333 3000\"><path d=\"M145 15 v585 v1800 v585 c2.667,10,9.667,15,21,15\nc10,0,16.667,-5,20,-15 v-585 v-1800 v-585 c-2.667,-10,-9.667,-15,-21,-15\nc-10,0,-16.667,5,-20,15z M188 15 H145 v585 v1800 v585 h43z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.25em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size4\">]</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>γ</mi><mo>∈</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\gamma \\in [0,1)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7335em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\">γ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 是折扣因子。本篇只借用 MDP 的语言来说明状态、动作与长期回报，不展开策略学习算法。</p>\n<p>再放松&quot;完全可观测&quot;假设——智能体看不到完整世界，只能通过工具返回观察到局部信息——问题进一步升级为<strong>部分可观测马尔可夫决策过程（POMDP）</strong>。这正是网页智能体的真实处境：它不知道下一页长什么样，只能点进去才知道。POMDP 求解需要维护对隐藏状态的<strong>信念（belief）</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>b</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>s</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">b(s)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，这一点直接启发了第三章<a href=\"../adaptation/reflection-self-critique\">反思与自我批评</a>中 ReflAct 维护并反思&quot;信念—目标&quot;对齐的设计。</p>\n<p>实践含义很直接：环境越接近 POMDP，越不该把整条计划提前定死，越应依赖<a href=\"../paradigms/react-interleaved\">ReAct 交错推理</a>那样的走一步看一步。</p>\n<h2 id=\"世界模型-先预测后承诺\">世界模型：先预测后承诺</h2><p>四元组里的转移函数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span></span> 往往未知，但规划仍需要回答「做了这个动作，接下来大概会怎样」。世界模型就是一个预测器 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>T</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>s</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>a</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\hat{T}(s,a)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1968em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9468em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2523em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1667em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>：它根据历史转移、环境规则或检索到的相似经验，预测候选动作的后果，让规划器在真正产生副作用前做有限前瞻。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;  S[当前状态] --&gt; A1[候选动作 A]&#10;  S --&gt; A2[候选动作 B]&#10;  A1 --&gt; W[世界模型预测]&#10;  A2 --&gt; W&#10;  W --&gt; O1[预测后果与置信度]&#10;  O1 --&gt; V[约束与价值评估]&#10;  V --&gt; C[只执行获选动作]&#10;  C --&gt; R[真实观察]&#10;  R --&gt; U[比较预测误差并更新记忆]\">flowchart LR\n  S[当前状态] --&gt; A1[候选动作 A]\n  S --&gt; A2[候选动作 B]\n  A1 --&gt; W[世界模型预测]\n  A2 --&gt; W\n  W --&gt; O1[预测后果与置信度]\n  O1 --&gt; V[约束与价值评估]\n  V --&gt; C[只执行获选动作]\n  C --&gt; R[真实观察]\n  R --&gt; U[比较预测误差并更新记忆]</pre><p>世界模型不一定是单独训练的神经网络，也可以是符号模拟器、API 沙箱、检索到的转移案例，或让 LLM 生成结构化后果预测。它的价值在于把不可逆动作变成「先模拟、再承诺」；它的危险则是<strong>错误前瞻会系统性误导计划</strong>。2026 年 WorldEvolver 的实验强调了三个实用构件：用真实转移形成情节记忆，从预测—观察偏差提炼规则，并只在预测置信度足够时向下游规划器提供前瞻（<a href=\"https://arxiv.org/abs/2606.30639\">WorldEvolver, arXiv 2606.30639</a>）。</p>\n<p>因此世界模型必须输出置信度和可追溯依据，不能把预测伪装成事实。低置信度时退回交错执行，通过真实观察缩小不确定性；高风险动作即使预测乐观，也要经过确定性约束或人工审批。评测时应同时测转移预测准确率与最终任务成功率，因为更像真的预测不一定被规划器正确使用。</p>\n<h2 id=\"分层与层级任务网络-htn\">分层与层级任务网络（HTN）</h2><p>直接在原子动作空间里搜索长程任务会爆炸——这就是为什么人类规划出差时不会一上来就想&quot;先迈左脚还是右脚&quot;，而是先想&quot;订票、订酒店、报备&quot;这些高层任务，再逐层细化。<strong>层级任务网络（HTN, Hierarchical Task Network）</strong> 把这种直觉形式化：定义一组<strong>方法（method）</strong>，每个方法把一个抽象任务分解为更细的子任务，直到全是可直接执行的<strong>原始任务（primitive task）</strong>。</p>\n<p>HTN 在 LLM 时代获得了新生。2025 年的 ChatHTN 用 LLM 在&quot;没有现成方法可用&quot;时即兴生成一个任务分解，再交还给 HTN 引擎继续推进，且被证明是<strong>可靠的（sound）</strong>——任何它产出的解都保证正确求解原问题（<a href=\"https://arxiv.org/pdf/2511.12901\">ChatHTN / Online HTN, arXiv 2511.12901</a>）。这是&quot;LLM 的灵活分解&quot;与&quot;符号规划的正确性保证&quot;罕见的结合范例。HTN 作为一种具体的分解策略，详细机制留给<a href=\"../paradigms/task-decomposition\">任务分解</a>展开；这里只确立它在形式化谱系中的位置：HTN 是在抽象层级上做的分层规划。</p>\n<h2 id=\"pddl-与-让-llm-写规划模型\">PDDL 与&quot;让 LLM 写规划模型&quot;</h2><p>另一条把 LLM 与经典规划缝合的路线是：不让 LLM 直接输出动作序列，而让它把自然语言任务<strong>翻译成 PDDL</strong>（Planning Domain Definition Language，经典规划的标准描述语言），再交给久经考验的符号规划器（如 Fast Downward）求解。这样 LLM 只负责它擅长的&quot;语言到形式化&quot;映射，搜索的完备性由符号求解器兜底。2025 年一项综述系统梳理了这条&quot;LLM 作为规划形式化器&quot;的路线及其在可靠性上的优势（<a href=\"https://arxiv.org/pdf/2503.18971\">LLMs as Planning Formalizers, arXiv 2503.18971</a>）。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>路线</th>\n<th>LLM 负责</th>\n<th>求解器负责</th>\n<th>优点</th>\n<th>短板</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>LLM 直接规划</td>\n<td>全部（分解+排序）</td>\n<td>无</td>\n<td>灵活、零形式化成本</td>\n<td>无完备性保证</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>LLM → PDDL → 符号求解</td>\n<td>翻译为形式化</td>\n<td>搜索求解</td>\n<td>完备、可验证</td>\n<td>需可形式化的封闭域</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>LLM-HTN（如 ChatHTN）</td>\n<td>即兴分解</td>\n<td>层级展开+校验</td>\n<td>灵活且可靠</td>\n<td>工程复杂</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>选哪条，取决于你的域能否被形式化：封闭、规则明确的域（如物流调度）适合走 PDDL 路线；开放、语义模糊的域（如网页操作）只能靠 LLM 直接规划加重规划兜底。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>规划问题最小可形式化为四元组 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">⟨</mo><mi>S</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>A</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>T</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>G</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">⟩</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\langle S, A, T, G \\rangle</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">⟨</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">G</span><span class=\"mclose\">⟩</span></span></span></span></span>，求解即找一条从 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>s</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">s_0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 到目标集 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>G</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">G</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">G</span></span></span></span></span> 的动作序列。</li>\n<li>LLM 智能体规划牺牲经典规划的完备性/最优性保证，换取对开放、模糊、动态环境的适应力。</li>\n<li>按转移与可观测性，问题从确定性路径搜索升级到 MDP，再到 POMDP；环境越接近 POMDP，越该走一步看一步而非预定全程。</li>\n<li>世界模型用预测转移 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>T</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\hat{T}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9468em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9468em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2523em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1667em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 支持「先模拟、再承诺」，但错误前瞻会放大偏航，必须带置信度、预测误差反馈与选择性使用。</li>\n<li>HTN 在抽象层级上分解任务，ChatHTN 用 LLM 即兴生成方法且保持可靠性。</li>\n<li>&quot;LLM → PDDL → 符号求解器&quot;路线把灵活性与完备性缝合，但只适用于可形式化的封闭域。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li>同章上一篇：<a href=\"why-planning\">为何需要规划</a> —— 本篇为其直觉提供数学骨架。</li>\n<li>同章下一篇：<a href=\"planning-taxonomy\">规划范式谱系</a> —— 把本篇的取舍轴铺成完整地图。</li>\n<li>HTN/PDDL 作为分解策略的工程展开：<a href=\"../paradigms/task-decomposition\">任务分解</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"规划问题形式化","id":"规划问题形式化"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"确定性、马尔可夫与部分可观测","id":"确定性-马尔可夫与部分可观测"},{"level":2,"text":"世界模型：先预测后承诺","id":"世界模型-先预测后承诺"},{"level":2,"text":"分层与层级任务网络（HTN）","id":"分层与层级任务网络-htn"},{"level":2,"text":"PDDL 与\"让 LLM 写规划模型\"","id":"pddl-与-让-llm-写规划模型"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"为何需要规划","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/llm-agent-planning/foundations/why-planning"},"next":{"title":"规划范式谱系","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/llm-agent-planning/foundations/planning-taxonomy"}}